<view class="page">
 <view class="title">当前设备同步声明</view>
 <view>只声明本任务当前设备的队列状态。其他离线设备、缺失证据和管理员复核仍需分别核实。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}">{{notice}}</view>
 <view>待上传 {{pending}} · 待清理 {{cleanup}} · 缺失/拒绝提示 {{unresolved}}</view>
 <view wx:if="{{status}}">本设备当前状态：{{status.device.current ? '声明仍有效' : '需要重新确认或处理缺失'}}</view>
 <button bindtap="onRefresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新当前授权与状态</button>
 <button bindtap="onDeclare" disabled="{{busy || retry || !status || pending || cleanup}}">核对并声明本机已同步</button>
 <button wx:if="{{retry}}" bindtap="onRetry" disabled="{{busy || !status}}">原键重试未确认操作</button>
 <navigator url="/pages/inventory-pending/index">查看本机待上传与回执</navigator>
</view>
